						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#149">I've stepped down at lead recruitment</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							Just so you know I've demoted myself.. hehe so I&quot;m no longer an officer just regular guild member.<br />
<br />
21 days and counting...<br />
<br />
Sherea
						</td>
