					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							Please ask new members to come here to http://www.guildsay.com with password  6969 to register their character, and to send an email to kwanja@alaweb.com to join CA mailing list when they join or if you see a new member name.<br />
This is a great site for viewing fellow member info and the mailing list is great for personal communication with all in CA.<br />
I would like to also suggest that more members of like level group and hunt together as a unified group of CA....I am willing to help all level groups when I am online.<br />
Take care all.
