					<tr>
						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#77">Meeting</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							Paian, our new guild leader since Syntily left us, has called an emergency meeting on Saturday, February 3rd, 2001 7pm EST at the ButcherBlock crossroads.<br />
<br />
Tabled for discussion:<br />
01. Does Paian want to remain as leader?<br />
02.Who will assume leadership, if he does not want?<br />
03. Who will assume CA website maintanence?<br />
04. Who will assume CA mailing list maintenance?<br />
05. Who will assume GuildSay maintenance?<br />
06. Should there be a main leader for CA with an assistant leader for each continent with three assistants?<br />
07. Should CA welcome all people to CA with only requirement be that they are casters?<br />
08. Should current members be allowed secondary that is not caster? Or, only by special request?<br />
09. Should new members be sponsored and their sponsor held responsible for them?<br />
10. Should there be a probation period for new members? <br />
11. Should new members be required to be at first meeting after joining for guild members to meet them?<br />
12. What does all members see as the future of CA?
						</td>
					</tr>
